{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57052","headline":"举场旧话 二 · 佚名","name":"举场旧话 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"貌谨气和，见面少，闻名多。\n（古人有言。\n见多成丑之谓也。\n凡後进游历前达之门，或虑进趋揖让，偶有蹶失，则虽有烜赫之文，终负生疎之谓。\n故文艺既至，第要投谒及时，不必孜孜求见也。\n如其深知己下岁寒之契，师友则不然也）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}